WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.450 --> 00:00:06.549
. We've been speaking on the program about
the United States as a global laughing stock

00:00:06.549 --> 00:00:08.290
under Donald Trump.

00:00:08.290 --> 00:00:10.670
This is not just something I say.

00:00:10.670 --> 00:00:11.670
It's the truth.

00:00:11.670 --> 00:00:12.920
And we have new data.

00:00:12.920 --> 00:00:17.760
Sometimes when I talk about the United States
as a laughing stock under Trump, people write

00:00:17.760 --> 00:00:20.130
in and say, David, the world respects Trump.

00:00:20.130 --> 00:00:22.770
The world knows Trump does what's best for
us.

00:00:22.770 --> 00:00:27.380
And they don't like that because we win and
maybe they lose.

00:00:27.380 --> 00:00:31.810
No, the reputation of the United States is
in the toilet.

00:00:31.810 --> 00:00:36.520
There's a new Pew Research Center study since
Donald Trump took office as president.

00:00:36.520 --> 00:00:39.700
The image of the United States has hugely
suffered in many countries.

00:00:39.700 --> 00:00:42.780
The United States reputation is at a record
low.

00:00:42.780 --> 00:00:48.500
Looking at the last 20 years, if you look
at the U.K., France, Germany, Japan, Canada,

00:00:48.500 --> 00:00:54.510
Australia, in every single one of those countries,
favorability for the United States is the

00:00:54.510 --> 00:00:56.470
lowest it has been in 20 years.

00:00:56.470 --> 00:01:04.129
It is at the worst point now that it was throughout
the entire Bush presidency, Obama presidency

00:01:04.129 --> 00:01:06.130
and Donald Trump presidency.

00:01:06.130 --> 00:01:08.399
Right now, right now is the low point.

00:01:08.399 --> 00:01:13.069
The numbers were already atrocious during
the first three years of Trump's presidency,

00:01:13.069 --> 00:01:17.950
but it is corona virus and Donald Trump's
completely failed response that has really

00:01:17.950 --> 00:01:20.420
hurt him in the last six months.

00:01:20.420 --> 00:01:27.799
Only 15 percent of 13 major countries think
the United States has done a good job handling

00:01:27.799 --> 00:01:29.009
coronavirus.

00:01:29.009 --> 00:01:34.579
If you look at a chart of confidence in the
American president over time among Western

00:01:34.579 --> 00:01:39.999
European countries, you see that it's sort
of trended down under Bush.

00:01:39.999 --> 00:01:46.270
Trust in the American president was much higher
in Western Europe during Barack Obama, and

00:01:46.270 --> 00:01:52.670
then it dropped even lower during Donald Trump
than it was during the George W. Bush administration.

00:01:52.670 --> 00:01:57.159
And it makes a lot of sense if you pay attention
to what's going on now.

00:01:57.159 --> 00:01:58.419
Very interesting.

00:01:58.419 --> 00:02:05.380
If you look at trust in Trump versus trust
in other leaders across these 13 countries,

00:02:05.380 --> 00:02:14.750
this is based on Australia, Belgium, Canada,
Denmark, France, Germany, Italy, Japan, Netherlands,

00:02:14.750 --> 00:02:20.760
South Korea, Spain, Sweden and the U.K. across
those 13 countries.

00:02:20.760 --> 00:02:24.400
You see that the least trusted leader is Donald
Trump.

00:02:24.400 --> 00:02:32.390
83 percent across those 13 countries have
no confidence in Donald Trump, followed by

00:02:32.390 --> 00:02:35.310
President Xi of China and Putin of Russia.

00:02:35.310 --> 00:02:41.200
In other words, Putin and Xi are more trusted
than Donald Trump.

00:02:41.200 --> 00:02:47.299
On the other end, Germany's Angela Merkel
is the most trusted at 76 percent, followed

00:02:47.299 --> 00:02:49.760
by French President Emmanuel Macron.

00:02:49.760 --> 00:02:50.760
And then Boris Johnson.

00:02:50.760 --> 00:02:52.590
It is not about left or right.

00:02:52.590 --> 00:02:58.459
Boris Johnson and Angela Merkel and even McCrone
are no extreme liberals.

00:02:58.459 --> 00:03:00.069
It is not about that.

00:03:00.069 --> 00:03:04.750
The world recognizes Trump is a buffoon who
cannot be trusted.

00:03:04.750 --> 00:03:08.400
They think we're stupid for voting such a
clown into office.

00:03:08.400 --> 00:03:12.310
Remember that Trump said on Twitter back in
2014.

00:03:12.310 --> 00:03:16.550
We need a president who isn't a laughing stock
